	(descr "PROVISIONAL (reset part not final, WP3). XKB TS-1186F-B-A (LCSC C908470) right-angle SMD tactile switch, 3.5 x 2.9 mm body, actuator towards +y (board edge), 2 x 0.8 mm holes for the locating pegs. Pads on both faces (hand-soldered on the underside). Land pattern from the XKB TS-1186F-X-X drawing (pads 1.2 x 0.6 at x +-2.0, y +-0.9), pads lengthened 0.4 mm outward for hand soldering. Pins 1+2 (y<0) and 3+4 (y>0) are internally joined, so the footprint uses pad numbers 1 and 2 only.")
